<title>UK: FEK sets 10 billion peseta matador bond.</title>
<headline>FEK sets 10 billion peseta matador bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell (Madrid).</p>
<p> BORROWER   FINNISH EXPORT CREDIT</p>
<p> AMT    10 BLN PTA    BASE     **6M-MIBOR  MATURITY    26.DEC.06</p>
<p> TYPE   FIX/REV FRN   MARGIN     +47 BP    PAY DATE    29.FEB.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   ISS PRICE  PAR	 FULL FEES   20 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	**UNTIL 26.DEC.01, THEN 16 PCT LESS 12M MIBOR IF</p>
<p>		NOT CALLED</p>
<p> LISTING    AIAF	DENOMS (M) 1	   SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
